\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Decomposition at the measured classifier and static-side validation. (a) Ceiling loss is about six times larger than learnability loss. (b) The error is concentrated: one row carries roughly $0.36$ of the off-diagonal mass while five rows are identity rows. (c) The exact static form of \eqref  {eq:rhoconf} tracks simulation across six noise levels $\beta $, 50 seeds each, median absolute error 0.93 percentage points.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
