\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces The crossover on the canonical environment. Classifier noise steepens the static baseline by 58\% but also flattens the learner's curve, so the horizon moves 2.4\% later rather than earlier.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
