\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces A better classifier does not imply an earlier crossover. $T^{*}$ diverges at the accuracy where the bucket's best arm flips and its top-two gap vanishes.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
